John> Yves Choquette <choquett> wrote:
>> A year ago, we bought a DEC 3000 Model 600S AXP Workstation.  Actualy, we are
>> looking for a server who is at least twice faster.  A look at the specs tells
>> me that an AlphaServer 2100 5/250 would provide us a lot more than twice the
