Yes, you can use a VAXstation 3100 to boot the VAXstation 3200.  You 
should have cluster licenses for both.  You need to set up the 3100 as 
a cluster boot node, then boot the 3200 as a satellite.  You can then 
BACKUP/IMAGE the 3100's system disk to one of the RA81s.

