Actually, it is not a standard order item.  But if you wish this
combination, or any NT/OpenVMS/UNIX combination, be careful when you
order:  most ALPHA OpenVMS and UNIX part numbers do not include a
floppy drive.  Since you will probably want one for NT, order an NT
ALPHA part number and add on extra memory and the UNIX or OpenVMS
license AND media (need PAL code CDROMs!!!)


I have done this many times and never had a problem.

Hope this helps.

Robert W. Washam,
First Network Consulting.




