a steady stream of video signal which is generated at 70+ KHz (not to
be mistaken with  the Hz). I personally don't know of any "standard"
PC video cards which is capable of generating such high frequency
signal. Also the video card has to keep up with the high refresh rate
demand of the monitor such as running 1280x1024@72-75 Hz.

