Alan> shelf in the AlphaServer 2100 cabinet?

According to the Systems and Options Catalog for 2100 4/233, 4/275 and
5/250 systems, you need the second Power Supply if you have

	- Fully Configured system includes second storage assembly, or
	- More than two CPUs are installed, or
	- Two CPUs and more than one memory board installed.

Number three above can be ignored under 4/200 systems.  So the answer
is yes, you need a second power supply.

