The product is the CIQBA+ and was manufactured by MTI.  The part number
(according to the Feb/94 Systems and Options catalogue) for the 4000/600 is
2T-CIQBA-46.  It consists the adapter, an MTI-supplied VMS software driver, an
asynch communications interface and an installation kit with 10-meter standard
cable set.

I can't find this product mentioned in the latest S&O catalogue so I don't know
if this means if Digital isn't reselling the product or if it was just dropped
from the catalogue.  I checked MTI's Web site (which is quite hostile to
non-graphics browsers), and can't find any mention of the CIQBA.

