Richard,

I'm a DEC reseller not one of their spokespersons. Identifying real Alpha
based NT solutions outside of marketing literature is a weakness that has
never been fully solved by anyone in particular. Therefore, your question
is not stupid.

Microsoft has Visual C for both Alpha and Intel. Both include the OpenGL
libraries. Applications written for NT are source code compatible between
