From: toon@moene.indiv.nluug.nl (Toon Moene)
Subject: Yes, was: Stack allocation hosed in Digital Unix 3.2C ?
Date: 1996/02/05
Message-ID: <1058@moene.indiv.nluug.nl>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 138508075
sender: toon@moene.indiv.nluug.nl
