enough to read or write several tapes, other times it will fail before
initialiasing a single tape ...

The system is a MicroVAX II (KA630 v1.3), with 16Mb of RAM on a pair
of EMC2 8Mb boards. Other adapters are: DEQNA, TK50 controller, Emulux
(qd32?) MSCP disk controller and a DZQ11.

