I have a spare TK50 controller, but substituting this into the system
caused VMS to complain of "controller errors", rather that "device
off-line". Using the first TK50 controller (the "device off-line" one
;) I ran the MicroVAX Customer Diagnostics (from TK50!) and
everything, even the TK50 controller, passed. What gives?

Oh, and I tested the voltages to the TK50 drive itself. Both 12V and
