>This may be a stupid question but is NT for the Dec Alpha a special flavor of 
>NT or is it the same OS?  If it's the same, then can the regular version of 
>MS-VC++ run and compile programs for the Dec-Alpha?

It's a special flavor in that, yes, it is different from the Intel version
of NT: They won't run the same binaries.  To answer your question, however,
get the Alpha version of MS-VC++.  Just recompile your app.  Unless you do
something Intel specific, porting is a snap (just rebuild on the Alpha...)


