>
>Hi All,
>we are planing to buy a new server that will be used for 10% of
>time for databases, and all another time as a WWW server with large
>archive ( probably > 100-200 Gb ) and approximately 20,000 daily
connections.
>We can spend smth like $50,000 - $ 70,000 on this and we have large
discounts
>both from Sun and DEC, so we can get Sun Ultra 170 with various
add-ons or
>practically bare Aplha 3 ( + Oracle for Sun or Alpha ). Both stations
>with 128 Mb RAM and 100 Gb HD. We were trying to carefully investigate
both
>cases but failed to come to the decision, can you please submit to us
various
>considerations and recomendations concerning this case.
>		Thank you in advance,
>			Alexei Novikov.
>e-mail: anovikov@heron.itep.ru
>
>Institute of Theoretical
>and Experimental Physics
>Moscow, Russia.
