Unfortunately we are familiar with this problem. The way we 
got around it was to create another group with the same gid.

soft:*:3000:users.... ( up to 1014)
soft2:*:3000:users2... ( up to 1014)

The users in group soft2 appear in group soft2, but obviously
when they create files, they belong to the 3000 group - which
is the only important point here.


